      "content": "SP 90 NW      CHOLESBURY-CUM-ST. LEONARDS      HAWRIDGE                                                (south west side) 2/71                        \t               Gateway Cottage and                                                Tudor Cottage - -                                              II Cottage.  C17 altered and extended.  Timberframe, with red brick infill and refacing.  Old tiled roof.  Gateway Cottage has two storeys.  South west elevation with modern door, one 3-light and two 2-light casements, two 3-light casements to first floor.  1-storey wing on left with timber framing exposed in gable.  Large offset chimney at north east end of main cottage.  Tudor Cottage is formed from a 1-storey and attic north east wing, with a modern wing to the north west.  Rendered and painted, old tiled roof, modern casements. RCHM I p 191 MON 4. Listing NGR: SP9446406482"
    }
  ],
